{"sourceUrl":"https://yic.cas.cn/yjsjy/yjsxxgg/202505/t20250508_7646033.html","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:00.859387+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://yic.cas.cn/yjsjy/yjsxxgg/202505/t20250508_7646033.html","html":"<div>\n<div><p><span>中国科学院烟台海岸带研究所（以下简称</span><span>烟台</span><span>海岸带所）地处美丽的海滨城市烟台</span><span>，</span><span>是中国科学院大学研究生培养点之一</span><span>，</span><span>每年招收硕士</span><span>、</span><span>博士研究生</span><span><span>60余名</span></span><span>。</span><span>为引导优秀大学生了解海岸带科学研究，</span><span>激发大学生从事科研的兴趣和热情</span><span>，烟台</span><span>海岸带所“亲近蔚蓝</span><span>，</span><span>走进海岸带”暑期夏令营活动拟在<span>2025</span></span><span>年<span>7</span>月下旬举行</span><span>，</span><span>欢迎全国高校优秀本科生踊跃报名。</span></p><p><strong><span>一</span></strong><strong><span>、</span></strong><strong><span>活动内容及安排</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>   活动内容：</span></strong><span>主</span><span><span>要包括学</span>术报<span>告、实验室参观、招生咨询、台站考察、户外拓展、考研经验交流等</span></span><span>。</span></p><p><strong><span>预计招收人数：</span></strong><span><span>90</span></span></p><p><strong><span>活动时间及形式</span></strong><span>：<span>预计</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span>年<span>7</span>月</span><span><span>14</span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span>18</span></span><span>日举行</span><span>，</span><span>具体安排</span><span>见后续通知</span><span>。</span></p><p><strong><span>二</span></strong><strong><span>、</span></strong><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p><p><span>1．</span><span><span>2026</span></span><span>届优秀毕业生（在读大三本科生）</span><span>，</span><span>海洋科学</span><span>、</span><span>环境科学</span><span>、</span><span>生态学</span><span>、</span><span>生物学</span><span>、</span><span>地学</span><span>、</span><span>化学及其相关专业。</span></p><p><span>2．</span><span>学习成绩优秀，</span><span>本科期间总成绩在本学院或专业排名前<span>20%</span></span><span>，预计获得本校</span><span>推免资格者优先。“双一流”</span><span>学校</span><span>的学生若学习成绩未达到前<span>20%</span></span><span>，</span><span>但预计在本校能获得推免资格</span><span>，</span><span>有出色的科研成果者可适当放宽条件。</span></p><p><span>3．</span><span>成绩优异，呈现出</span><span>较强或潜在的研究能力</span><span>，</span><span>拟报考</span><span>烟台海岸带所</span><span>免试推荐硕士研究生、直博生的三年级（<span>2026</span></span><span>年毕业）在校本科生</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>4．</span><span>对海岸带研究有浓厚兴趣</span><span>，</span><span>有志于海岸带系统科学的研究工作</span><span><span>,</span></span><span>有较强或潜在的研究能力。</span></p><p><strong><span>三</span></strong><strong><span>、</span></strong><strong><span>在学待遇</span></strong></p><p><span><span>1. </span></span><span>研究生宿舍全部为独卫空调双人间</span><span>。</span></p><p><span><span>2. </span>全部在所研究生均可</span><span>享受</span><span>硕士生</span><span><span>3.6-5.8</span>万元/年</span><span>，</span><span>博士生</span><span>7-8.6</span><span>万元/年</span><span>的</span><span>基本</span><span>奖助学金</span><span>，成绩优异者还可申请国家奖学金及中国科学院各类奖学金。</span></p><p><strong><span>四</span></strong><strong><span>、</span></strong><strong><span>申请流程</span></strong></p><p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>. </span></span><span>网上申请</span></p><p><span>个人信息填报：登录中国科学院大学夏令营<span>/</span>暑期学校在线申请系统（</span><span>网址：</span><span></span><span>http://zxsq.ucas.ac.cn/login/index/sc</span><span>），夏令营（非暑期学校）选择：中国科学院大学</span><span>202</span><span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span>年“亲近蔚蓝，走进海岸带”暑期夏令营，承办单位</span><span>选择：烟台海岸带研究所。</span></p><p><span>2.</span> <span>网上报名截止时间为<span>6</span>月<span>25</span>日。</span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>. </span>申请流程： <span>http://zxsq.ucas.ac.cn/login/instroctionForFilling/cs</span>。</span></p><p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>. </span>资格审核：</span><span>资格审核拟于</span><span><span>6</span>月<span>30</span>日前</span><span>完成，申请者可通过报名系统查询是否通过。</span></p><p><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>. </span>信息确认：通过审核者须</span><span>在<span>7</span>月</span><span><span>3</span></span><span>日前</span><span>登录报名系统选择确定是否同意参加</span><span><span>,</span></span><span>逾期将视为自动放弃</span><span>。</span></p><p><strong><span>五</span></strong><strong><span>、</span></strong><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p><p><span><span>1. </span>中国科学院大学<span>2025</span></span><span>年大学生暑期夏令营申请表（报名系统生成</span><span>，</span><span>本人签名扫描件</span><span>）；</span></p><p><span><span>2. </span>本科成绩单（加盖教务处公章</span><span><span>，</span></span><span>扫描件）；</span></p><p><span><span>3. </span>专业排名证明（加盖教务处或院系公章</span><span><span>，</span></span><span>扫描件）；</span></p><p><span><span>4. </span>英语水平证明复印件（如四<span>/</span>六级</span><span><span>，</span></span><span>扫描件）；</span></p><p><span><span>5. </span>个人身份证明材料（</span><span>扫描</span><span>身份证正<span>/</span>反面</span><span>、</span><span>学生证里<span>/</span>外面）；</span></p><p><span><span>6. </span>其他能力证明材料（如推荐信</span><span>、</span><span>已发表论文<span>/</span>专利的首页复印件</span><span>、</span><span>各类证书复印件等扫描件</span><span>，</span><span>整理为一个<span>PDF</span>）。</span><strong><span>此项为辅助材料</span></strong><strong><span>，</span></strong><strong><span>为非必交材料</span></strong><strong><span>，</span></strong><strong><span>自愿提交。</span></strong></p><p><span>请各位同学在整理材料时</span><span><span>,</span>将上述材料</span><strong><span>扫描形成电子版并按以上顺序整合为一个</span></strong><strong><span><span>PDF</span></span></strong><strong><span>文件</span></strong><span>，发送到研究生部邮箱<span>yjs@yic.ac.cn</span>；</span><strong><span>文件名为</span></strong><strong><span>本科</span></strong><strong><span>学校</span></strong><strong><span>名称</span></strong><strong><span><span>-</span>专业<span>-</span>姓名</span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span>此次夏令营申请不接收纸制材料和纸制申请，申请人一律采取网上报名。</span></p><p><strong><span>六．其他</span></strong></p><p><span>1．</span><span>参加夏令营的学生必须遵守我所的相关规定，按照统一的安排进行工作和活动。</span></p><p><span>2．</span><span>所有营员在营期间研究所将免费安排食宿，统一为学员购买人身意外伤害险。</span></p><p><span>3．</span><span>凭票报销单程城际间来营路费，区间应为学校、家庭所在地或实验实习地（需学校开具证明）到研究所，乘坐标准为火车硬座、硬卧，高铁<span>/</span>动车二等座、轮船三等座及以下，其他交通方式可参照同路段动车（或高铁）二等座标准报销，若实际产生价格更低则凭票报销。</span></p><p><span>4．</span><span>如遇</span><span>恶劣天气等</span><span>其他不可抗力情况，举办时间及方式可能会做部分调整，请关注后续通知。</span></p><p><span></span><strong><span>七</span></strong><strong><span>、</span></strong><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p><p><span>通讯地址：烟台市莱山区春晖路<span>17</span>号中科院烟台海岸带所研究生部</span> </p><p><span>邮</span>  <span>编：<span>264003</span></span></p><p><span>联系人：</span><span>苗老师  </span><span>付</span><span>老师</span> </p><p><span>电</span>  <span>话：<span>0535-</span></span>21090<span><span>1</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span>，</span><span><span>0535-</span></span><span><span>210901</span></span><span><span>1</span></span> </p><p><span>电子邮件：</span><span>yjs@yic.ac.cn</span></p><p><span><span>QQ</span>交</span><span>流群：</span><span>20</span><span>25</span><span>年<span>YIC</span>暑期夏令营，群号：</span><span><span>857200466</span></span><span>，</span><span>验证信息：本科院校<span>+</span>姓名</span><span>+专业</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://yic.cas.cn/yjsjy/yjsxxgg/202505/W020250508561428817985_ORIGIN.png\"/></p><p><span>烟台海</span><span>岸带所期待与您一起“跨越界限</span><span><span>，</span></span><span>共创价值”！</span></p><p><span> </span><span> </span>     <span>                                                               </span> <span>研</span><span>究生部</span></p><p><span><span>                                                                 2025</span>年<span>5</span>月<span>8</span>日</span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><strong><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span><span>     往期精彩回顾：</span></span></span></strong></span></p><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://yic.cas.cn/yjsjy/yjsxxgg/202505/W020250508561429176459.png\"/></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><strong>      学术论坛：</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span><span></span></span></p><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://yic.cas.cn/yjsjy/yjsxxgg/202505/W020250508561429750669.png\"/></p><p><strong></strong></p><p><strong>         </strong></p><p><strong><span>      实验室参观：</span></strong></p><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://yic.ca